 "strings": {
  "Did you hire them to protect you?": "",
  "Did you hire them\nto protect you?": "",
  "Out with it already.": "",
  "Quit acting like you've\ngot any goddamn dignity.": "",
  "Your dignity's already shot, pal.": "",
  "Who would've thought the scientist who was gonna\nsave the world'd turn out to be some pervy asshole?": "",
  "They thought you'd save the world, huh?\nTurns out you're just a pervy asshole.": "",
  "You're name's gonna go down in history\nif this gets out. And not how you're hopin'.": "",
  "One thing's for sure! If this gets out,\neveryone really will know your name.": "",
  "Stop... I'm begging you, please.": "",
  "Stop... I'm begging you...": "",
  "Who were those thugs\nat the batting center?": "",
  "Hitmen.\nOn the Ministry of Health payroll.": "",
  "They were from the Ministry of Health...\nTheir hitmen.": "",
  "Ichinose's payroll, in other words.": "",
  "That means they're on\nIchinose's payroll... right?": "",
  "I think you mean \"yes, sir.\"": "",
  "Yes... sir...": "",
  "Ichinose-san knows I've been abducted.": "",
  "...Look, think about this rationally!\nIchinose-san knows I've been abducted.": "",
  "More of them could rush in here\nany minute if you don't release me...!": "",
  "If you don't release me this instant,\nmore of them could rush this place at any time!": "",
  "Eh. If you haven't noticed, we've got this\nwhole \"fighting\" thing pretty down by now.": "",
  "Let 'em come. Haven't you noticed\nthe all-star roster we've got here?": "",
  "Next question. It's about what happened\nthree years ago.": "",
  "Next question. About what happened\nthree years ago...": "",
  "An Alzheimer's patient at the ADDC by the name of Waku-san\nwas murdered. His body found buried far out in the mountains.": "",
  "An Alzheimer's patient at the ADDC was murdered.\nHis body, found buried far out in the mountains.": "",
  "At the time,\nShinpei Okubo was thought to be the killer.": "",
  "They said it was\ndone by Shinpei Okubo.": "",
  "But the truth is, it was an unforeseen consequence\nof AD-9, which Shono had administered to this Waku-san.": "",
  "But the truth is, it was a death caused by AD-9,\nwhich Shono had administered to the patient.": "",
  "You knew, didn't you?": "",
  "You knew what really happened,\ndidn't you?": "",
  "What, cat got your tongue? Guess you're\nabout to become internet famous then.": "",
  "What, cat got your tongue?\nGuess we're gonna have to make you internet-famous...": "",
  "W-Wait!": "",
  "Answer me, Kido!": "",
  "Then answer me!\n...Kido.": "",
  "Yes. I knew.": "",
  "...Yes. I knew.": "",
  "Who told you? When? How?": "",
  "Who told you? When and how?": "",
  "I'm sorry, I can't say any more than that. If I did, I...\nPlease, just give me some time to figure things out!": "",
  "I'm sorry, I can't say any more. If I did, then I'd be...\nPlease, I just need some time!": "",
  "Time's one thing I don't have. Shinpei Okubo's about\nto get executed for a murder he didn't commit.": "",
  "I don't <font_kind=yakuza_italic>have</font_kind> time. Shinpei Okubo's\nabout to get executed.": "",
  "I need to get every last bit\nof information out of you right here.": "",
  "So I need to get all the information\nout of you here and now.": "",
  "I'll even resort to torture if I have to.": "",
  "If it comes down to it...\nI'm not above torture.": "",
  "Torture!? You'd break the law\nover this!?": "",
  "B-But you're an attorney!\nYou'd even break the law!?": "",
  "What, that doesn't sound fun to you?": "",
  "Of course not!": "",
  "Then start talking!": "",
  "Nobody's gonna come help you now.": "",
  "Nobody's gonna come\nhelp you now.": "",
  "I'll give you a chance to think it over.\nYou better be ready by the time I come back.": "",
  "You get a moment to think this over.\nBy the time I get back, you better be ready.": "",
  "Kido's already a broken man.": "",
  "My guess? At this point,\nhe's just desperate to save his own skin.": "",
  "My guess? At this point, he's just desperate\nto save his own skin.": "",
  "Maybe you should take a breather.": "",
  "I'm sure giving Kido some time to stew'll make him realize talking's\nthe only option. We'll keep an eye on him in the meantime.": "",
  "Once he's had some time to stew, Kido's bound to talk.\nWe'll keep an eye on him in the meantime.": "",
  "Thanks, Sugiura.\nI appreciate it.": "",
  "You gonna be okay?": "",
  "Hey, even a guy like you needs to take breaks.\nYou've been up and out all freaking day.": "",
  "We're gonna be fine. <font_kind=yakuza_italic>You're</font_kind> the one\nwho's been up and out all freaking day.": "",
  "Ready to talk yet?\nWe're waiting.": "",
  "Feel like talking yet?": "",
  "...Okay.": "",
  "Three years ago, Shono killed a patient\nby experimenting on him with AD-9.": "",
  "Three years ago... Shono killed a patient\nby experimenting on him with AD-9.": "",
  "When did you find out?": "",
  "What about you?\nWhen did you find out?": "",
  "Right after the press conference.\nThe one where we announced AD-9 to the world.": "",
  "After AD-9... was announced\nto the world.": "",
  "Shono told me himself.": "",
  "Shono told me after the conference...": "",
  "Just thinking about it makes my blood boil,\neven after all this time...": "",
  "Even thinking about it now, it makes\nmy blood boil... after all this time...": "",
  "We'll keep tabs on Kido.\nYou go relax a bit.": "",
  "Good to go, Yagami-san?\nKido's had enough time to think.": "",
  "Is that all Shono told you?": "",
  "There's gotta be more.": "",
  "Waku-san wasn't the only person\nShono killed, was he?": "",
  "Shono didn't stop at one death, right?": "",
  "No. He needed Shinpei Okubo\nto take the fall...": "",
  "He needed Shinpei Okubo\nto take the fall... so...": "",
  "...And murdered Emi Terasawa\nto accomplish that.": "",
  "...He murdered Emi Terasawa.": "",
  "So you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>did</font_kind> know!": "",
  "Save it, Sugiura.\nWe're not done yet.": "",
  "We're not done talking yet.\nSave it.": "",
  "Fuck that!": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(We've got him right where we want him.\nHe won't hide anything anymore.)</color>": "",
  "What happened next?\nAfter Shono killed Emi.": "",
  "What happened next?\nAfter Shono killed Emi Terasawa.": "",
  "Don't you already know!?": "",
  "Do I have to say it!?\nYou know what happened!": "",
  "You had Hashiki murdered.": "",
  "...You had Hashiki murdered.": "",
  "I didn't!\nIt wasn't me!": "",
  "That wasn't my fault!": "",
  "Hashiki was digging around,\ntrying to find something wrong with AD-9.": "",
  "Hashiki was digging around\nfor AD-9's secrets.": "",
  "You and Shono didn't like that too much.": "",
  "You and Shono didn't like that\ntoo much.": "",
  "But you needed some help\nto take care of him.": "",
  "But... you needed some help\nto take care of him.": "",
  "Someone else who wanted to protect AD-9.\nThat person was...": "",
  "Someone else who wanted to protect AD-9,\nand profit off of it. That person was...": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The man Shono and Kido asked for help\nin protecting AD-9 was...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The person Shono and Kido asked for help\nin protecting AD-9 was...)</color>": "",
  "Hamura from the Matsugane Family.": "",
  "Hm? No, that was before\nI knew any yakuza.": "",
  "Hm? No, that was before I knew any yakuza.": "",
  "Exactly. In that case, it was...": "",
  "Right. In that case, it was...": "",
  "Kuroiwa, from the Kamurocho police.": "",
  "Hm? No, I didn't know him at the time.": "",
  "Ichinose from the Ministry of Health.": "",
  "The guy who founded the ADDC. Made it a place all\nthe old-guard Ministry execs could retire to.": "",
  "The ADDC's founder. The one who made it a place\nall the old guard Ministry execs could retire to.": "",
  "Yes. Shono and I went to Ichinose-san\nand pleaded with him to help us.": "",
  "...Yes. Shono and I... We went to Ichinose-san\nand pleaded with him to help us.": "",
  "After all, he's known for being well-versed\nin political matters... both aboveboard and otherwise.": "",
  "After all, he's known for being well-versed in political matters...\nboth aboveboard and otherwise.": "",
  "So... we told him everything. About Waku-san dying\nin the experiment, about Emi Terasawa...": "",
  "We told him everything. About the patient dying\nin the experiment, about Emi Terasawa...": "",
  "Every last detail.": "",
  "Without hesitation, Ichinose-san agreed\nto help us with the coverup.": "",
  "And Ichinose-san, well... he agreed without hesitation\nto help us with the coverup.": "",
  "According to him,\nprotecting AD-9 was top priority.": "",
  "According to him, protecting AD-9\nwas our top priority.": "",
  "Hence why he decided to silence Hashiki.": "",
  "That's why... he decided to\nsilence Hashiki.": "",
  "Ichinose-san knew he was Kajihira's spy\nfrom the start... and acted accordingly.": "",
  "Ichinose-san knew all along. How Hashiki\nhad been Kajihira's spy from the beginning.": "",
  "Meanin' he's the one who first dragged Hamura\nn' Kuroiwa into this bullshit.": "",
  "So it started with Ichinose. He dragged\nHamura n' Kuroiwa into this bullshit.": "",
  "Real barrel of fucking monkeys.": "",
  "Damn... Real barrel of fucking monkeys.": "",
  "With Hashiki out of the way... all that was left\nfor us to do was complete AD-9.": "",
  "But we realized something. If we entered clinical trials\nand another patient died... our dream too would be dead.": "",
  "But we realized something. If we entered clinical trials and\nanother patient died... Our dream would die too.": "",
  "The ADDC would be no more... and all our sacrifices\nwould have been for nothing.": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Your</font_kind> sacrifices?\nHow can you say that with a straight face?": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Your</font_kind> sacrifices? How can you say that\nwith a straight face?": "",
  "You're not the ones who died\nfor some bullshit drug!": "",
  "Talk. How did you deal with that?": "",
  "Through all my hesitation,\nShono kept pushing.": "",
  "Even through all my hesitation...\nShono kept pushing.": "",
  "Aggressive to a damn fault.": "",
  "He said we couldn't be afraid of failure\nif we really wanted to finish AD-9.": "",
  "He said we couldn't be afraid of failure,\nif we really wanted to finish AD-9.": "",
  "That we needed to keep experimenting\nuntil we succeeded...": "",
  "He also said the only way\nto speed up development...": "",
  "And... he had his own ideas\nfor speeding up development.": "",
  "Was to keep conducting clinical trials\nin secret. Shono was adamant about that.": "",
  "Shono wanted to keep conducting clinical trials\nin secret to keep AD-9 alive.": "",
  "Think about it. If we could hide the fact\nthat our subjects were dying...": "",
  "If we could hide the fact that AD-9's subjects\nwere dying, whatever that took...": "",
  "...We could continue experimenting,\ndespite the risks.": "",
  "...then we could continue experimenting\ndespite the risks.": "",
  "In order to do so, we needed a way to quickly\nprocure and discard test subjects.": "",
  "For that, we needed a way to quickly procure\nand discard test subjects.": "",
  "With that, it would only be a matter of time\nuntil AD-9 was complete.": "",
  "With that, it wouldn't be long\nuntil AD-9 was safe.": "",
  "And those test subjects...\nwere the Kyorei Clan men.": "",
  "And your test subjects were\nthe Kyorei Clan men.": "",
  "Ichinose-san listened to every single one\nof Shono's requests.": "",
  "Ichinose-san, he... listened to every\nsingle one of Shono's requests.": "",
  "My only role in all of this was obtaining\nthe funds required.": "",
  "All I did... was keep the cash flowing in\nfor their endeavors.": "",
  "And so, money flowed into the ADDC\nfrom the Ministry of Health.": "",
  "Money flowed into the ADDC,\ndirect from the Ministry of Health.": "",
  "Money which I gave to Shono...\nAllowing him to build a secret lab in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Money which I gave to Shono... allowing him\nto build a secret lab in Kamurocho.": "",
  "A secret lab?": "",
  "It's where he carries out\nall of his human experiments.": "",
  "His human experiments...\nall happen there.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hamura mentioned a secret lab for doing the\nhuman experiments back at Honmaruen.)</color>": "",
  "Where exactly is this lab?": "",
  "So, this lab. Where in Kamurocho is it?": "",
  "I'm not sure of the specific location.": "",
  "Well, I... I'm not sure exactly.": "",
  "I... try not to come between Shono and Ichinose-san\nunless absolutely necessary.": "",
  "I try not to come between Shono and Ichinose-san...\nunless it's absolutely necessary.": "",
  "So that lab is where all the killings happen.\nWhere those Kyorei guys were slaughtered.": "",
  "So that's where all the killings happen.\nWhere those Kyorei guys were slaughtered.": "",
  "If anywhere's gonna have evidence...\nit's there.": "",
  "If we want evidence, that's where\nwe're gonna find it.": "",
  "You sure you don't know where it is?": "",
  "Hey. You sure you don't know\nwhere it is?": "",
  "Detective Kuroiwa would,\nof course.": "",
  "Detective Kuroiwa would.\nWithout a doubt.": "",
  "He's not as talkative as you, though.": "",
  "Slight hitch there.\nHe's not as talkative as you.": "",
  "There was another person involved\nin setting up the lab.": "",
  "There was another person\ninvolved in setting up the lab.": "",
  "A subordinate of Ichinose-san.\nI believe his name was... Ishimatsu.": "",
  "I've heard that name before.\nHe was the middle-man between Hamura and Shono.": "",
  "I've heard that name. Hamura mentioned him...\nHe was the middleman.": "",
  "Where's this Ishimatsu guy?": "",
  "In Kamurocho. There's a Ministry of Health\noffice up in the Millennium Tower.": "",
  "In Kamurocho. At the Millennium Tower...\nThere's a Ministry of Health office.": "",
  "Apparently he'll be in tonight.": "",
  "Wait, the Millennium Tower?": "",
  "What? Like a branch office?": "",
  "That's where they oversee Shono's secret lab.\nNobody knows the office is there.": "",
  "The sign out front even\nhas a different name.": "",
  "The sign out front even has\na different name.": "",
  "They really got a place like that...?": "",
  "That's Kamurocho for you...": "",
  "Well, Ishimatsu knows where the lab is,\nyeah? This'll be easy.": "",
  "Well, that works out. Ishimatsu knows where\nthe lab is, yeah? This'll be easy.": "",
  "Mhm. Just gotta strip him down\nand force him to talk.": "",
  "Yep.\nStrip him and grill him, right?": "",
  "Hold up. I've got a better idea.": "",
  "First, we give this Ishimatsu guy some\nkinda reason to go to the lab.": "",
  "First, we give this Ishimatsu guy some kinda reason\nto go to the lab.": "",
  "Then we just, follow him\nfrom the Millennium Tower.": "",
  "Then, we just follow him\nfrom the Millennium Tower.": "",
  "Not bad. Ishimatsu himself'll\nlead us straight there.": "",
  "Not bad. Ishimatsu himself can\nlead us straight there.": "",
  "But how're we gonna get him to go?": "",
  "Yeah, but... How're we gonna\nget him to go?": "",
  "Well, we'll... uh...": "",
  "We'll get our buddy Kido\nhere to give him a call.": "",
  "It's fine. We'll have our buddy Kido\ngive him a call.": "",
  "Say something about how we're\nclosing in on the lab.": "",
  "Say something about how we're\nclosing in on Shono's hideout.": "",
  "Tell him you need him over\nthere to stand guard.": "",
  "Then, tell him you need a guy\nover there to stand guard.": "",
  "Y'know, that might just work.": "",
  "Nice, that's good.": "",
  "And what, you think I'll just agree to this?": "",
  "You... You want me to call Ishimatsu!?": "",
  "You better. If you don't want us\nspreadin' your little video, that is.": "",
  "Better do it right. If you don't want us\nspreadin' your little video, that is.": "",
  "That settles it, then.\nWhat does Ishimatsu look like?": "",
  "...He's in his fifties, always wears a gray suit.\nA short man. Not that much over five feet.": "",
  "...He's in his fifties. Always wears a gray suit.\nA short man. Not much over five feet.": "",
  "Ah, and he always wears gloves!": "",
  "That could be any regular-ass\nold dude in this town.": "",
  "Sounds like any regular-ass old dude.": "",
  "Anything else?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Of course not!": "เปล่าซะหน่อย!",
  "...Okay.": "...โอเค",
  "Fuck that!": "ไม่มีทาง!",
  "Anything else?": "มีอะไรอีกไหม?"
 }
